      "\u03c6(a)^T \u03c6(b) = (1^2 2^2 \u221a2 1*2)(3^2; 4^2; \u221a2 3*4) = (1 4 \u221a2 2)(9; 16; \u221a2 12) = 9+64+48 = 121",
      "[a^T b]^2 = (1*3 + 2*4)^2 = 11^2 = 121"
    ]
